blocks.en:
The generators of Diff Gen are not seen in training, and a different generator may reproduce the driver’s motion with different timing, smoothness or tracking noise.
We model a generator as an unknown transformation of the driver’s motion and simulate it during Stage 1.
Each training sample is transformed by one of six families, chosen uniformly at random:
(i) identity;
(ii) a smooth global time warp;
(iii) a time shift of each facial part;
(iv) a frequency response of each facial part, either a low-pass filter or a boost of high frequencies;
(v) temporally correlated noise on each landmark, mimicking tracking errors; and
(vi) a composition of two of (ii)–(v).
The facial parts are those of the Anat tokens, and each transformed sample is normalized again by steps 3 and 4 of Sec. 4.1 .
Following GroupDRO [ 17 ] , the motion loss is computed separately for each family k k as ℒ mot , k \mathcal{L}_{\text{mot},k} and replaced by ∑ k q k ​ ℒ mot , k \sum_{k}q_{k}\mathcal{L}_{\text{mot},k} , where the weights are updated at every step as q k ← q k ​ exp ⁡ ( η ​ ℒ mot , k ) q_{k}\leftarrow q_{k}\exp(\eta\,\mathcal{L}_{\text{mot},k}) and renormalized to sum to one, so that the families whose motion is predicted worst are emphasized.

blocks.zh:
Diff Gen的发电机在训练中不被看到,不同的发电机可能会以不同的时间,平滑或跟踪噪音来复制驾驶员的运动.
我们把发电机模拟成驱动器运动的未知变化,并在第一阶段模拟它。
每个培训样本都由六个家庭中的一个进行转化,并统一随机选择:
(一) 身份;
(二) 全球时间曲速平稳;
(三) 面部每一部分的时间变化;
(四) 每个面部部分的频率反应,或是低通滤波器,或是高频率的助推;
(五) 每一个地标上的时间相干并模仿跟踪错误的噪音;
(六) 第(二)至(五)两项的组成。
面部部分是Anat令牌的,每个被改变的样品再次被第4.1节的第3步和第4步正常化.
